{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、しほ(加藤史帆)の誕生日 です!\nおめでとう〜。\nいつも、仲良くしてくれて嬉しい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私としほは、真夏さん尊敬しているどうし でもあります。\nリスペクト!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、真夏さんを見習ってがんばっていこうね〜。\n理想のアイドル!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、しほの生写真があたりました!\nやったd(^O^)b"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、なーこクッキング⑦ です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メレンゲクッキー を作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用意するのは、\n☆卵白(卵一つ分)☆砂糖 30g☆クッキングペーパー\nのみです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この材料なら、いつでもありますね´`*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卵白と砂糖を混ぜます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2QWQJAV88YMR7BF41VKHP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3回に分けて混ぜます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドミキサーで混ぜ混ぜ。\nこんな感じ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2QXYF1CFR9GSKYXG26W1P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツヤツヤでちょっと固くなってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、クッキングペーパーに絞ります!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R06YR13MG56PBHJA8S94","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルッと、ひと回し 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絞るときは、生クリームを買った時に付いていた絞りをポリ袋にセットして絞っています。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R1HES5F23ZY5D5M2K2B2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絞りはいつも、洗ってとっておいてます。\n便利〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを、120℃に余熱したオーブンで100℃で1時間じっくり焼きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R2YFPG36QET6DAYGYRTH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、実は お茶漬けのもと で顔を作りました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ごま が無かったのです･･･。\n白ごまとキヌアはあったのですが｡ﾟ(ﾟˆoˆﾟ)ﾟ｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーン!(電子レンジ)\n完成。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R4BF6H94D40N5EEDW8D2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、白くない!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"粉砂糖をつかうと、白く焼けるみたいです(´-`).｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりですが、\n今日はなんの日でしょう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールの日 ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メレンゲクッキーと、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R5KB7884WF5RJ7MNW619","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n久しぶりにツインテール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2R6PR3RFQTJ1SK7519ZYN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nついたー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶漬けのもと で作った顔つきメレンゲクッキーは、甘しょっぱくて意外と合いました!\nびっくり(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"材料も少なくて簡単なのでぜひ、みなさんも作ってみて下さい❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶漬けのもと いいですよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}